# #186: with smashes on the strong button, a direction + A from stand is a tilt, a flick in the old
# dash-smash window not included: A with a direction out of any dash frame or a run is the dash attack.
# Thrall a; styles: 6 forward tilt, 8 down tilt, 19 dash attack; 2-4 are the smashes.
#! chat -dev quick hero thrall
# A half stick forward and A on one frame from standing: the forward tilt.
60 a stick 0.6 0
60 a tap A 2
62 a stick 0 0
#! expect a 60-63 applied attack 1 style 6
# Flick back, A a frame later, on dash frame 1-3 where A used to give the forward smash: the dash attack, no forward tilt.
150 a stick -1 0
151 a tap A 2
153 a stick 0 0
#! expect a 150 ground action 1
#! expect a 151-154 applied attack 2 style 19
# Down + A from a crouch: the down tilt.
250 a stick 0 -1
258 a tap A 2
264 a stick 0 0
#! expect a 258-261 applied attack 3 style 8
# Dash held past the window, then A: the dash attack.
330 a stick 1 0
338 a tap A 2
345 a stick 0 0
#! expect a 338-341 applied attack 4 style 19
# Run, then A: the dash attack.
420 a stick -1 0
452 a tap A 2
460 a stick 0 0
#! expect a 435-437 ground action 2
#! expect a 452-455 applied attack 5 style 19
#! absent a 1-560 applied attack 1 style 4
#! absent a 1-560 applied attack 2 style 4
#! absent a 1-560 applied attack 3 style 3
#! absent a 1-560 applied attack 4 style 4
#! absent a 1-560 applied attack 5 style 4
560 a capture
600 a press VIEW
670 a release VIEW
